<article class="legal-page">
    <h1>Cookie Policy</h1>
    <p>
        This Cookie Policy explains how cookies and similar technologies are used on this personal website (the “Website”).
        The Website is designed to work without analytics, advertising or profiling cookies.
    </p>

    <h2>1. What are cookies?</h2>
    <p>
        Cookies are small text files that a website can store on your device. They can be used to remember preferences,
        enable technical functions, measure visits or create profiles for advertising.
    </p>

    <h2>2. Cookies used by this Website</h2>
    <p>
        This Website does not intentionally place analytics, advertising, social media, profiling or behavioural tracking
        cookies on your device. It does not use cookies to identify you or track your activity across websites.
    </p>
    <p>
        Hosting or security infrastructure may use strictly necessary technical mechanisms to deliver, protect or maintain
        the Website. These mechanisms are not used by the controller for marketing or user profiling and, where present,
        are exempt from consent when they are strictly necessary for the service requested by the visitor.
    </p>

    <h2>3. Consent</h2>
    <p>
        Because this Website does not use non-essential cookies, it does not require a cookie consent banner for its current
        functionality. If analytics, advertising, embedded content or other non-essential technologies are introduced in the
        future, they will be enabled only after obtaining consent where required by applicable law.
    </p>

    <h2>4. Browser controls</h2>
    <p>
        You can configure your browser to block or delete cookies. Blocking strictly necessary technologies may prevent some
        website functions from working correctly. Browser settings do not replace consent where a website requires consent
        for non-essential cookies.
    </p>

    <h2>5. Third-party websites</h2>
    <p>
        Links to external services such as GitHub and LinkedIn do not load their cookies on this Website. If you follow one
        of those links, the third party may use cookies under its own policy. Please review the privacy and cookie policies
        of those services before using them.
    </p>

    <h2>6. Updates</h2>
    <p>
        This policy will be updated if the Website starts using additional cookies or similar technologies. The latest version
        will always be published on this page.
    </p>

    <p>
        For privacy questions, contact <a href="mailto:contactdm.yt@gmail.com">contactdm.yt@gmail.com</a>. See also the
        <NavLink href="privacy">Privacy Policy</NavLink>.
    </p>
</article>